# Loaded only by `npm run build` (mode=production).
#
# Deliberately empty: the production bundle is served by the API itself, out of
# its wwwroot, so the SPA and the API are one origin (the Funnel hostname). Relative
# URLs like "/api/question" hit the right host on their own, and the auth cookie
# stays first-party — which is what makes login work in Firefox and Safari.
#
# Only set this if the SPA ever moves back to separate hosting, and then it must
# be the API's absolute public origin with no trailing slash.
#
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is baked into the bundle at build time and is publicly
# visible in the shipped JS — never put secrets here.
VITE_API_URL=
PORT=3001